{{Paineel Era}}

Paineel is the secret city of the Erudites who did not agree with Erud's vision, and have fled the council and established a city on the remains of an ancient city of Paineel, taking its name for their own. 

The entrance to Paineel is buried in rubble at launch, and the tunnel is mined open come Feb 2000 patch. [https://eqlwiki.com/Timeline] Evil Erudites will begin in [[Erudin]] in the meanwhile. Evil class vendors are available in huts in [[Toxxulia Forest]].

